    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なに、この柱のキズ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What are these? The
marks on this pillar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ……&lt;Dio&gt;くんが
暴れた跡？
いや、&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh... Did &lt;Dio&gt; get a little
too wild? Or...maybe &lt;Mel&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ち、違いますよ。
それはふたりの背を
測った跡です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-No, it's nothing like
that. That's where we
measured our heights.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ……よく見たら、
数字が書いてある</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... Yeah, if I look closer,
I can see little numbers, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>初めはわたしの方が
伸びるの早かったけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At first, I grew a little
faster than he did, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;はここ２、３年で
急に背が伸びたね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For the last two or three years,
&lt;Dio&gt;'s been growing really fast.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>寝る子は育つって
言うかラ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They do say the kids who
sleep more, grow more.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『寝る子』？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Kids who sleep more"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>１日１２時間は平気で
寝てたもんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He sleeps for twelve hours a day,
without a care in the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しょうがねだろ。
疲れてたんだから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't help it.
I'm just tired.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……森の中に遊びに出て、
うろうろしてたら、
そりゃ疲れるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well, of course you get tired
after you wander around
playing in the forest all day.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>疲れてふらふらして、
足踏み外して
崖から落ちるしね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then he gets too tired,
is unsteady on his feet, and
falls down a cliff.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは遊びじゃなくて、
調査だって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, I wasn't playing that
time. I was investigating.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;エトスハウス&lt;White&gt;の周りに
危険な場所がねーか
魔物がいないかってさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was making sure there's not
any dangerous places or monsters
hiding near &lt;Red&gt;Ethos's House&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>嘘だぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Liar...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's the truth...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたの、&lt;Dio&gt;くん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong, &lt;Dio&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who knows...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;も&lt;Mel&gt;も……
まだまだ……もっともっと、
大きくなるんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt; and &lt;Mel&gt;...both
have...a lot more
growing up to do.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……エトちゃーん、
寂しいんでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Aw, Ethos. Are you
feeling a little lonely?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え……ち、違うよ。
寂しいっていうか、
嬉しい、かな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh...? N-No, not at all.
Actually, I'm a little more
happy than I am lonely.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちっちゃい頃はいつも
ぼくに甘えてた&lt;Dio&gt;が</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;'s been tied to my apron strings,
ever since he was little, but now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんなふうに、
口答えするのも……
なんか嬉しいんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When he talks back to me
like that... I'm actually kind
of happy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんも
あまえんぼさん
卒業しちゃったしね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And it looks like &lt;Mel&gt;'s
graduated from her
spoiled phase, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え？　わ、わたし、
あまえんぼさんじゃ
ないですよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh? B-But, I don't act 
spoiled at all, though?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまたせー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm back~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何持ってきたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's that you're holding?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>デッキブラシだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a deck brush.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>森の中に出かける時、
いつも武器に持ってただろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whenever I went out into the
forest, I'd take it with me to
use as a weapon, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275296</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱさ、しっくりと
手になじんでる武器、
使いたいよなー</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And you know, it feels
way better to use a
weapon you're used to~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275368</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>武器って……
それ、掃除の道具だよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"A weapon"... You know it's
meant for cleaning, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、チャンバラの時は
すげー役に立ったぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, but when I used it for
play-fighting, it was crazy strong!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトちゃん、心配しなくても、
&lt;Dio&gt;くんはまだまだ、
君の助けが必要かもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't think you have anything to worry
about, Ethos. It looks like &lt;Dio&gt; might
still need your help for a while longer...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275616</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんの話だよ、それ！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Th-The hell are
you talking about!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
